      "side": 1,
      "message": "This technically cannot overflow a uint64_t in the base WebGPU limits but it is not necessarily the case with increased limits. We could do something like:\n\n```\nuint64_t wgInvocations \u003d  wgSize[0] * wgSize[1] * wgSize[2]; // Assert limits don\u0027t allow overflowing a uint64_t maybe?\nuint64_t factorWGAndX \u003d uint64_t(workgroupCountX) * wgInvocations\nuint64_t factorYAndZ \u003d uint64_t(workgroupCountY) * uint64_t(workgroupCountZ);\n\nuint64_t totalInvocations \u003d factorWGAndX * factorYAndZ;\nDAWN_INVALID_IF(totalInvocations \u003c\u003d factorWGAndX, \"Total number of invocations overflowed 64 bits.\");\n\n```",
      "revId": "69c01ccfae899115bae75779c27aa2a646778fe1",
